comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-13T15:27:25.590Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence: focused SDK/contracts suite now proves six pre-implementation failures: no default budget resolution/enforcement, no unbounded cost escape hatch, comments-audit/assurance absent from shared read surfaces, and exact command summaries cover only roots. Command: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/sdk/read-output-contracts.spec.ts tests/unit/commands/contracts-command.spec.ts tests/unit/sdk/agent-output-contracts.spec.ts (77 passed, 6 failed as expected)."
  "2026-08-13T17:12:49.552Z","harness:codex","Completion evidence: the deterministic corpus now exercises 32 measured surfaces, including comments-audit, note-heavy deep notes, assurance, bare/status lists, and a 10,465-token negative control above the 6,000-token JSON default. Runtime defaults bind without flags; explicit unbounded preserves exhaustive consumers. Telemetry is disabled in the gate. Linked tests passed (46 focused tests plus 88-command package-first dogfood). Exact full coverage passed 7,262 tests at 100/100/100/100. Packed npm, npx, Bun, and bunx temporary-project acceptance passed."
  "2026-08-13T18:11:50.360Z","harness:codex","PR #999 TDD red: a mocked assurance command exited 1 with empty stdout and the token gate still passed, proving tolerated failures were measured without validating status/report. Focused review suite: 92 passed, 4 failed as expected."
  "2026-08-13T18:50:46.199Z","harness:codex","PR #999 review-resolution evidence: tolerated assurance failures now validate the declared exit status and parse a structurally valid assurance report before token measurement. Empty stdout, unexpected status, malformed JSON, wrong gate/trigger/dry-run/exit-code/verdict, and missing assertions fail closed. Focused gate suite passed 23/23; representative token gate passed 32 surfaces with a 10,465-token unbounded negative control."
